   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exceptional foreign business trip of Slovak Ambassador J. Bory to Kabul</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Mimoriadna ZPC VZ&#xda; Teher&#xe1;n J. B&#xf3;ryho do K&#xe1;bulu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;V&#xa0;d&#x148;och 31.08.-04.09.2013 sa nakoniec podarilo uskuto&#x10d;ni&#x165; viac kr&#xe1;t odlo&#x17e;en&#xfa; mimoriadnu ZPC ve&#x13e;vyslanca J&#xe1;na B&#xf3;ryho do K&#xe1;bulu.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Hlavn&#xfd;m d&#xf4;vodom pre realiz&#xe1;ciu ZPC bolo na z&#xe1;klade pokynu (ako aj financovania n&#xe1;kladov na ZPC) INSL uskuto&#x10d;ni&#x165; rokovania s&#xa0;cie&#x13e;om odblokova&#x165; rie&#x161;enie oh&#x13e;adne prenajatej nehnute&#x13e;nosti z&#xa0;obdobia &#x10c;SFR v&#xa0;dispoz&#xed;cii MZVaEZ SR v&#xa0;K&#xe1;bule (bli&#x17e;&#x161;ie v&#xa0;&#x10d;. 2.096/2013-IRVV).&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;&#x10e;al&#x161;&#xed;mi d&#xf4;vodmi bola &#xfa;&#x10d;as&#x165; ve&#x13e;vyslanca SR na odovzd&#xe1;van&#xed; afganskej strane dvoch projektov financovan&#xfd;ch v&#xa0;r&#xe1;mci ODA SR prostredn&#xed;ctvom SlovakAid (&#x10d;. 2.097/2013-IRVV a&#xa0;&#x10d;. 2098/2013-IRVV). V&#xa0;nadv&#xe4;znosti na sl&#xe1;vnostn&#xe9; ceremoni&#xe1;ly sa uskuto&#x10d;nili kr&#xe1;tke stretnutia vv. J. B&#xf3;ryho s&#xa0;ministrom vysoko&#x161;kolsk&#xe9;ho vzdelania Obaidullah Obaid a&#xa0;ministerkou zdravotn&#xed;ctva Suraya Dalil.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Okrem vy&#x161;&#x161;ie spom&#xed;nan&#xfd;ch aktiv&#xed;t podarilo sa uskuto&#x10d;ni&#x165; 3 rokovania s&#xa0;predstavite&#x13e;mi MZV Afganistanu - Ambassador Hamidullah Nasser Zia, GR 4. (Eur&#xf3;pskeho) politick&#xe9;ho odboru (&#x10d;. 2.100/2013-IRVV), Ambassador Hamid Sidig, GR a&#xa0;&#x161;&#xe9;f protokolu a&#xa0;Munir Ghaisy, z&#xe1;stupca GR 4. (Eur&#xf3;pskeho) politick&#xe9;ho odboru, &#x10f;alej rokovanie s&#xa0;ministrom dopravy a&#xa0;letectva Daoud Ali Najafi (&#x10d;.2.099/2013-IRVV) a 1. n&#xe1;mestn&#xed;kom ministra obrany Saran Pooh-Enayatullah-Nazarim (&#x10d;.2.101/2013-IRVV).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;From August 31 through September&#xa0; 09, 2013 the foreign business trip of Ambassador Jan Bory to Kabul was finally held. The reasons were the participation of the Ambassador of the Slovak Republic to transfer&#xa0;the two projects funded by the ODA through SlovakAid (No 2.097/2013-IRVV and no. 2098/2013-IRVV).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
